        "title": "concession, 就是 + qualification",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "After a concession, 就是 can introduce the one remaining reservation. It does not identify two nouns as the same thing here.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "书很好，就是太贵了。",
                "pinyin": "shū hěn hǎo ， jiùshì tài guì le 。",
                "meaning": "The book is good; the only problem is that it is too expensive.",
                "audio": "812e217885526b234e17eff73889551645f5a2026ef30a9413fc380d2f899833"
              },
              {
                "text": "他很好，就是不爱说话。",
                "pinyin": "tā hěn hǎo ， jiùshì bù ài shuōhuà 。",
                "meaning": "He is nice; he just does not like talking.",
                "audio": "0ba7c46493c129602c3432aba143d0b0955020710cb1909695c39221c544634d"
